Description: Bundles synthesised insurance datasets (a motor-insurance
    portfolio and loss-development cube, plus property and life reference
    tables) together with a self-contained 'blockr' example workflow: a
    simulation-based excess-of-loss treaty pricer built entirely from the
    general blockr block set. The motor data is derived from
    'insuranceData::dataCar' (de Jong & Heller, 2008) and
    'ChainLadder::MW2014' (Wuthrich & Merz, 2014).
